                <pb facs="0607" n="495" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg495"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister
                        Sherrill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Repeat to Petropolis and Santiago, for information, the following telegram which
                    has been sent to the legation at Quito. [Supra.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
